 "method_zh": "闸门是把设计判断转成可复核动作的关口。每个闸门声明输入文件、执行程序、通过规则、停止规则、建议责任角色与非 AI 等效流程；状态一律为 design_target，只有在官方边界、现场测绘与专业模拟到位后才可能改写。",
 "method_en": "A gate turns a design judgement into a checkable action. Each gate declares input files, procedure, pass rule, stop rule, a suggested owner role and a non-AI equivalent. Every gate stays at design_target until the official boundary, field survey and professional simulation are available.",
